cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Demo 13: Typed Commitments and Coverage Cues (teaching toy)"
message: >-
  If you use this teaching demo in coursework, please cite it as below.
  All instances, cues and verdicts are synthetic; this is not research
  evidence.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Radanliev
    given-names: Petar
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/radanliev/agentic-security-demos"
keywords:
  - teaching
  - llm-assessors
  - coverage-cues
  - agreement-gates
  - synthetic-fixtures
abstract: >-
  Teaching toy illustrating how a shared wrong coverage cue lets two
  assessors agree on a wrong answer, escaping an agreement gate.
  Six synthetic instances, two deterministic toy assessors, stdlib only.
